{"seq":2,"slug":"nerf-mlp","title":"NeRF 的 MLP 表示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/neural-rendering-nerf-gaussian/nerf/nerf-mlp","wordCount":1507,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"nerf-的-mlp-表示\">NeRF 的 MLP 表示</h1><p><a href=\"volume-rendering\">体渲染</a> 给了我们一道积分，但积分里那个「每个空间点的密度和颜色」从哪来？原始 NeRF 的回答惊人地简单：用一个全连接网络 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 把它记住。输入一个 5D 坐标（位置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{x}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 加方向 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">d</span></span></span></span></span>），输出密度和颜色，整个场景就是这 60 万个权重。但简单背后藏着三个不简单的设计——位置编码、视角分离、分层采样——少了任何一个，渲染就从照片级垮成一团糊。这一篇讲这三处关键。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>NeRF 用一个 MLP 实现辐射场：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo>:</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>↦</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_\\theta: (\\mathbf{x}, \\mathbf{d}) \\mapsto (\\sigma, \\mathbf{c})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↦</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。训练时，对每条光线采样若干点，把每点的坐标喂进网络拿到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\sigma_i, \\mathbf{c}_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，再用上一篇的 alpha 合成出像素颜色，与真值比对、反向传播更新 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span>。推理时同理，只是位姿是新的。整个场景的几何（哪里实、哪里空）藏在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 的分布里，外观藏在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{c}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 里。</p>\n<p>关键在于网络结构的两段式：先用一段 MLP 从位置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{x}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 算出密度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 和一个中间特征，再把这个特征拼上方向 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 过最后几层算出颜色 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{c}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">c</span></span></span></span></span>。这个「密度只看位置、颜色才看方向」的拆分不是随意的，下面会讲它为什么必须如此。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[空间点 x] --&gt; B[位置编码 gamma x&lt;br/&gt;升到高频]&#10;  B --&gt; C[MLP 主干 8 层]&#10;  C --&gt; D[密度 sigma&lt;br/&gt;只依赖位置]&#10;  C --&gt; E[中间特征向量]&#10;  F[视角方向 d] --&gt; G[方向编码 gamma d]&#10;  E --&gt; H[拼接 特征 + gamma d]&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I[MLP 颜色头 1-2 层]&#10;  I --&gt; J[颜色 c&lt;br/&gt;视角相关]&#10;  D --&gt; K[体渲染 alpha 合成]&#10;  J --&gt; K\">flowchart TD\n  A[空间点 x] --&gt; B[位置编码 gamma x&lt;br/&gt;升到高频]\n  B --&gt; C[MLP 主干 8 层]\n  C --&gt; D[密度 sigma&lt;br/&gt;只依赖位置]\n  C --&gt; E[中间特征向量]\n  F[视角方向 d] --&gt; G[方向编码 gamma d]\n  E --&gt; H[拼接 特征 + gamma d]\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I[MLP 颜色头 1-2 层]\n  I --&gt; J[颜色 c&lt;br/&gt;视角相关]\n  D --&gt; K[体渲染 alpha 合成]\n  J --&gt; K</pre><h2 id=\"位置编码-让-mlp-学得到高频\">位置编码：让 MLP 学得到高频</h2><p>直接把原始坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{x} = (x, y, z)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 喂进 MLP，渲染结果会糊得没有细节。原因是 MLP 有「频谱偏置」——天然倾向于学低频的平滑函数，难以拟合纹理、边缘这类高频。NeRF 的解法是位置编码：用一组不同频率的正余弦把每个坐标分量升维。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>0</mn></msup><mi>π</mi><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>0</mn></msup><mi>π</mi><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>π</mi><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>π</mi><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma(p) = \\big(\\sin(2^0\\pi p), \\cos(2^0\\pi p), \\dots, \\sin(2^{L-1}\\pi p), \\cos(2^{L-1}\\pi p)\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2413em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>位置用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L=10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span>、方向用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L=4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span>。这相当于把输入映射到一个高频傅里叶基底上，MLP 在这个空间里就能轻松表达高频变化。位置编码是原始 NeRF 最画龙点睛的一笔，但它也埋下了慢的种子：要表达更高频细节就得堆更深的网络、采更多点。后来 <a href=\"nerf-acceleration\">NeRF 加速 (Instant-NGP)</a> 用可学习的哈希网格替换掉这套固定的正余弦编码，正是从这里破局——把「高频靠网络深度硬学」换成「高频靠显式网格直接查」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"视角分离-高光从哪来\">视角分离：高光从哪来</h2><p>为什么密度只看位置、颜色才看方向？因为物理上「这一点有没有东西」（密度）与你从哪看无关，而「这一点什么颜色」会随视角变——镜面高光、金属反射、湿润表面的光泽，都是视角相关效应。如果让密度也依赖方向，模型就能用「换个角度这里就变空」来作弊地拟合训练视角，导致几何崩坏、新视角穿帮。强制密度只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{x}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span></span></span></span></span>，是 NeRF 保证几何一致性的结构性约束。</p>\n<p>颜色那一头则需要方向输入才能拟合视角依赖。原始 NeRF 把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 编码后拼进颜色头来实现。值得对照的是，高斯泼溅用球谐函数（SH）来表达同一种视角依赖颜色——SH 是定义在方向球面上的一组基，几个低阶系数就能拟合平滑的视角变化，详见 <a href=\"../gaussian-splatting/gaussian-representation\">3D 高斯表示</a>。两条路线解决的是同一个物理问题，手段不同：NeRF 靠网络拟合，高斯靠解析基函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分层采样-把算力花在刀刃上\">分层采样：把算力花在刀刃上</h2><p>沿光线均匀采样极其浪费——光线大段穿过空气，密度为零，算了也白算；真正有信息的是物体表面附近薄薄一层。NeRF 用粗细两级网络解决：先用「粗网络」沿光线均匀采少量点，得到一个密度的粗略分布；据此构造一个概率密度，在密度高的区域（即表面附近）重新采样更多点，喂给「细网络」做精细渲染。这种重要性采样让有限的采样预算集中到表面，是质量与速度的折中。</p>\n<p>下表汇总三处设计各自治什么病。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设计</th>\n<th>治什么病</th>\n<th>不用会怎样</th>\n<th>后续路线的演化</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>位置编码</td>\n<td>MLP 频谱偏置、学不到高频</td>\n<td>渲染糊、丢纹理细节</td>\n<td>Instant-NGP 换成可学习哈希网格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>视角分离</td>\n<td>密度依赖视角会几何作弊</td>\n<td>几何崩坏、新视角穿帮</td>\n<td>高斯泼溅用球谐表达视角颜色</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分层采样</td>\n<td>均匀采样浪费在空气上</td>\n<td>算力爆炸或表面欠采样</td>\n<td>显式表示直接跳过空区域</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这三处合起来，才让一个朴素 MLP 在 2020 年首次把新视角合成做到照片级，定义了 <a href=\"../foundations/novel-view-synthesis\">新视角合成</a> 此后的评测标尺。代价是慢——训练一个场景要在单卡上跑一两天，这正是下一篇要攻克的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>原始 NeRF 用一个 MLP <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo>:</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>↦</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_\\theta:(\\mathbf{x},\\mathbf{d})\\mapsto(\\sigma,\\mathbf{c})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↦</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 实现辐射场，整个场景就是这组网络权重。</li>\n<li>位置编码用多频正余弦把坐标升维，克服 MLP 的频谱偏置，让它学得到高频细节。</li>\n<li>密度只依赖位置、颜色才依赖方向：前者保证几何一致性，后者拟合高光等视角相关效应。</li>\n<li>分层（粗细）采样把采样预算集中到物体表面附近，平衡质量与速度。</li>\n<li>三者合力首次实现照片级新视角合成，但训练慢（单卡一两天），催生了下一篇的加速工作。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>上游数学（密度与颜色如何合成像素）：<a href=\"volume-rendering\">体渲染</a></li>\n<li>直接破解「慢」的后继工作：<a href=\"nerf-acceleration\">NeRF 加速 (Instant-NGP)</a></li>\n<li>另一条路线如何表达视角颜色（球谐）：<a href=\"../gaussian-splatting/gaussian-representation\">3D 高斯表示</a></li>\n<li>跨库：MLP 的频谱偏置与表示能力，背景见深度学习视角的 <a href=\"../../generative-ai/generative-foundations/generative-model-landscape\">生成模型全景</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"NeRF 的 MLP 表示","id":"nerf-的-mlp-表示"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"位置编码：让 MLP 学得到高频","id":"位置编码-让-mlp-学得到高频"},{"level":2,"text":"视角分离：高光从哪来","id":"视角分离-高光从哪来"},{"level":2,"text":"分层采样：把算力花在刀刃上","id":"分层采样-把算力花在刀刃上"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"体渲染","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/neural-rendering-nerf-gaussian/nerf/volume-rendering"},"next":{"title":"NeRF 加速 (Instant-NGP)","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/neural-rendering-nerf-gaussian/nerf/nerf-acceleration"}}